      "text": "p-adic Asai L-functions of Bianchi modular forms — 11 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Preliminaries and notation\n\n**p-adic Asai L-functions of Bianchi modular forms**\n\n*David Loeffler and Chris Williams*\n\n42 pp, 11 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Preliminaries and notation; 3 Siegel units and weight 2 Asai–Eisenstein el; 4 Proving the norm relations (Theorem 3.13); 5 Asai–Eisenstein elements in higher weights; 6 The p-adic Asai L-function; 7 Interpolation of critical L-values; Appendix: An integral formula for the Asai L-f; Acknowledgements; References",
